      "parameters": {
        "content": "# 🎥 Wan 2.5 | Image → Video Automation\n\n**By [AI Automation Club](https://discord.com/invite/Am6Mdpnbg6)**\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 Workflow Overview\n\n* **Airtable Trigger** – new row or status update kicks things off.\n* **Parameters → Kie.ai** – all inputs are pushed to the Wan 2.5 API.\n* **Video Return** – generated video is auto-uploaded back to Airtable.\n\n---\n\n## 🔑 Required APIs\n\n* [Airtable](https://docs.n8n.io/integrations/builtin/credentials/airtable/?utm_source=n8n_app&utm_medium=credential_settings&utm_campaign=create_new_credentials_modal) – to store triggers + video links.\n* [Kie.ai](https://kie.ai/api-key) – the backbone for Wan 2.5 video generation.\n\n---\n\n## 📂 Helpful Resources\n\n* [Starter Airtable Base](https://airtable.com/appwtILummdsNptsI/shrYL2PrCL0Wop1ai) – copy & customize.\n* [Wan 2.5 Engine](https://kie.ai/wan-2-5) – docs + API playground.\n\n---\n\n## 💰 Pricing Snapshot\n\n* **480p** → $0.05 / sec\n* **720p** → $0.06 / sec\n* **1080p** → $0.10 / sec\n\n*(Costs scale linearly with duration)*\n\n---\n",
